OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen brings 84mph wind
OL,4,Agusts as thousands of UK homes without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreat Western Railway (GRW) warns of
OL,8,Fdisruption due to fallen trees on
OL,9,Fseveral train lines in Devon and
OL,10,FCornwall, while Network Rail Scotland
OL,11,Fsays trains will be slowed down along
OL,12,Fparts of the West and East coast main
OL,13,Flines
OL,15,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,16,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,17,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,18,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,19,FEngland
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
